new='''// SupportedTemplateMajor is the template library major version this CLI
// renders. An unpinned resolution only considers releases of this major, so a
// breaking library release reaches users through a CLI release that raises
// it, never by surprise. It is deliberately not derived from the CLI's own
// version: the two release trains break independently.
